Cell["\<\
Author: Sergio S\[AAcute]nchez Rentero
Contact: sergis15@ucm.es
Links: https://github.com/sergiosr150703-lang 

Project Context: This code is part of a Master\[CloseCurlyQuote]s Thesis in \
Theoretical Physics. The project investigates the canonical quantization of \
topological solitons in brane-world scenarios. In particular, this notebook \
takes care about computing the profile of classical Brane-Skyrmions through \
minimizing their energy functional. We first compute the corresponding \
equations of motion, and then we solve them with a Shooting method.

Last Updated: June 2026\
\>", "Text",
